// How many kept pairs share the greatest labeled margin.
// No pair returns nothing. A zero margin counts when it is the top.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mtop ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mtop rank

IMPULSE mtop 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mtop" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
